{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53249","headline":"诗偈 七十四 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 七十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人有一卷经，无相亦（《祖堂集》卷十五作「复」）无名。\n无人能（《祖堂集》作「解」）转读，有我不能听。\n如能转读得，入理契无生。\n非论菩萨道，佛亦不劳（《祖堂集》作「要」）成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53249.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53249","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}